ks.\n4. Agricultural insurance is essential for risk management.\nLet's examine each option in light of these points:.\n\nA) Scientific risk management is very important to ensure farmers' income.\n- This option aligns with the context, as the passage mentions the need for risk management to ensure income.\n\nB) With the help of agricultural insurance, the risk of agricultural producers can be effectively dispersed. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
