suggesting that the availability of a large domestic market space makes it more attractive for overseas enterprises to engage in trade with domestic enterprises, which in turn can lead to more RMB settlement transactions and better management of exchange rate risks for domestic enterprises.\n</think>\n<answer>\nD\n</answer>",
