messages:   27%|##7       | 163/600 [08:35<24:26,  3.36s/it][["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nThe application of the law refers to the specialized activities of the state judiciary organs to deal with cases by applying the law in accordance with the statutory powers and procedures.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, according to the above definition, which of the following acts is the application of the law?\n# Options:\nA) The customs officer thought zhang was suspected of smuggling and investigated him.\nB) The procuratorial organ carries on the investigation to wang mou's act of accepting bribes according to the populace report.\nC) According to relevant national  and regulations of law, li signs a house sales contract in a sales department.\nD) The public security bureau director convenes the working meeting for improving the quality of police handling cases.", '<think>.\nTo solve this logical reasoning problem, we need to carefully analyze the definition of "application of the law" provided in the context and then evaluate each option to see which one aligns with this definition.\n\nThe context states:.\n"The application of the law refers to the specialized activities of the state judiciary organs to deal with cases by applying the law in accordance with the statutory powers and procedures.".\n\nThis definition tells us that:.\n1. It involves specialized activities.\n2. It is carried out by state judiciary organs.\n3. It involves applying the law.\n4. It is done in accordance with statutory powers and procedures.\n\nLet\'s evaluate each option based on these criteria:.\n\nA) The customs officer thought Zhang was suspected of smuggling and investigated him.\n- This involves an investigation, but it is not carried out by a state judiciary organ. It is a customs officer, which is a law enforcement role, not a judicial one. Therefore, this does not fit the definition of "application of the law.".\n\nB) The procuratorial organ carries on the investigation to Wang Mou\'s act of accepting bribes according to the populace report.\n- This involves an investigation by a procuratorial organ, which is a state judiciary organ. The investigation is done according to the populace report, which aligns with the statutory powers and procedures. This fits the definition of "application of the law.".\n\nC) According to relevant national and regulations of law, Li signs a house sales contract in a sales department.\n- This involves signing a contract, but it is not an investigation or application of the law. It is a commercial transaction, which does not fit the definition of "application of the law.".\n\nD) The public security bureau director convenes the working meeting for improving the quality of police handling cases. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
