      "text": " C.\n\nD) If a few people in a group speak uncivilized languages and are not stopped, many people will soon speak uncivilized languages.\n- This fits the broken window effect. If uncivilized language is not addressed, it will likely spread to more people in the group.\n\nBased on the analysis, the option that does not belong to the broken window effect is C.\n</think>\n<answer>\nC\n</answer>",
