ysis, we see that if **A** is true, then B, C, and D must be false. This means that the only drawer that can contain a pen is the second drawer, as per statement C.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is:\nA) There is a pen in the second drawer.\n</think>\n<answer>\nA\n</answer>",
