 This option introduces a different factor (interest) that could influence concentration. However, it does not directly address the pattern of attention variation described in the context. It does not weaken the conclusion about the attention pattern.\n\nD) The time a person can fully concentrate is only 7 seconds.\n- This option directly challenges the pattern of attention described in the context. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
