grams and listen to peking opera. This option shows that Lao Sun is providing entertainment and comfort to his parents, which can be seen as a form of spiritual support.\n\nB) Lao Wu visits his parents daily, taking care of their lives meticulously, and they are very pleased. This option indicates that Lao Wu is providing emotional support and care, which is a form of spiritual support.\n\nC) Dean Li invited a children's orchestra to the nursing home, bringing happiness to the elderly. This option shows that Dean Li is providing a positive and uplifting experience for the elderly, which is a form of spiritual support.\n\nD) Lao Jiang follows his mother to her ballroom dancing class to prevent her from getting angry and to ensure her safety. This option does not primarily focus on providing emotional or spiritual support. Instead, it seems to be about ensuring safety and preventing anger, which are more practical concerns rather than spiritual needs. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
