er's claim about the local air quality being too bad.\n\nC) Not all air conditioners are affected by air quality.\n- This option suggests that there are other factors affecting the air conditioners' performance. While it introduces an alternative explanation, it does not directly address the engineer's claim about the local air quality being too bad. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
