angnan team, then statement 3 is true.\n- If the champion is Shannan team, then statement 3 is false.\n- If the champion is Shanbei team, then statement 3 is false.\n- If the champion is Jiangbei team, then statement 3 is false.\n\nFinally, let's check statement 4:.\n- If the champion is Shannan team, then statement 4 is false.\n- If the champion is Jiangnan team, then statement 4 is true.\n- If the champion is Shanbei team, then statement 4 is false.\n- If the champion is Jiangbei team, then statement 4 is false. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
