ils) to prevent potential issues during the exam. This also aligns with the definition of crisis management planning as it aims to reduce risks and losses.\n\nC) Faced with a sudden earthquake, xiao zhang was knocked to the ground and fortunately escaped.\n- This scenario describes an immediate response to a sudden event (earthquake) without any prior planning. It does not involve a comprehensive process of planning to prevent or reduce risks and losses. Therefore, this does not fit the definition of crisis management planning.\n\nD) A company filed a bankruptcy application to the court due to heavy debts and unable to pay off its due debts.\n- This scenario describes a situation where a company is facing financial difficulties and has already experienced a crisis (bankruptcy filing). Therefore, my final option is: "]]
